-------------- | ---------------  
platform       | -4.31  
region         | -2.87  
age_band       | -1.95  
demographic    | -1.44  
customer_type  | -0.78  

Hence, the ATTRIBUTE TYPE that shows the highest negative impact on sales is **platform**, with an average percentage change of **‑4.31 %** across the 12‑week “before” versus “after” windows centred on 15‑Jun‑2020.
